build requested 2026-09-03T21:40:00Z — 4.0.1, a METADATA release.

4.0 is READY_FOR_SALE, and Apple locks a live version's metadata, so the only
way to correct the store listing is a new version. This one carries no feature
work; it exists to fix what the product page says.

  · PRICE. The listing has stated the OLD monthly and yearly prices since the
    tiers changed on 2026-08-24 — roughly double what Apple actually charges.
    Anyone reading the page before installing was quoted twice the real cost.
    (Billing was never wrong; the paywall reads priceString from StoreKit.)
  · SPELLING. The first line of the description read "a chess coach that
    anylizes your games" — a misspelling of the one word the app is about, on
    the line that is all most people read.
  · SUBTITLE. Was EMPTY, 0/30 chars, for the life of the app. Now "Opening
    Trainer & Game Review" — a third of the indexed search surface, and the
    line under the app name in every search result.
  · KEYWORDS. Rebuilt: the old field was full at 100/100 while spending ~30
    characters on words already carried by the app NAME and the subtitle.

Also ships the walkthrough auto-start, the promoted next-step button, and the
first working store-review prompt (it had never once fired).
